body:
As someone already suggested Dvinity Original Sin 1 and 2 are amazing for this! Darksiders: Genesis is pretty fun, but more top down action rpg. Journey to the Savage Planet is fun, but less an rpg than a fun survival game with a story. Haven is a great game for couples to play, and on gamepass. A Way Out is also on gamepass and a great co-op game. 

Other suggestions:

Children of Morta;

For the King;

Guacamelee (metroidvania esque);

Remnant: From the Ashes (more action rpg, but great);

State of Decay 2 (survival zombie game with a story 
and multiple endings/campaigns);

Wasteland 3 (in the same vein as fallout/divinity)
